<title>USA: Stifel Financial to make stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Stifel Financial to make stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stifel Financial Corp said Friday its board of directors had declared a five-percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>Stifel said the board will distribute the dividend on February 18 to shareholders of record on February 4.</p>
<p>The financial services holding company had average shares of 4.5 million at the end of its third quarter.</p>
</text>
